<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened slightly against both the dollar and pound sterling on Friday in line with international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a commercial mean rate of 20.4865 to the dollar on Friday, from 20.4165 on Thursday, and at 33.6225 to the pound sterling, from 33.583 on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien  ++230 211-9555</p>
